    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 300,
      "id": "18741047a4d2a772",
      "text": "> [!cc-header]  💼  **Project Class** \n\n|Property|Description|\n|-|-|\n|id| Unique identifier|\n|Name|Project Name|\n|CompanyID|Project Customer|\n|Stakeholder|CustomerID|\n|StartDate| Date project starts|\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 340,
      "x": 500,
      "y": -700
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 240,
      "id": "a84bda99116f4e49",
      "text": "> [!cc-label-left]  🗂 Company Class \n\n\n|Property|Description|\n|-|-|\n|id| Unique identifier|\n|Name|Company Name|\n|Address|Street Address|\n\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 340,
      "x": -20,
      "y": -440
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 395,
      "id": "8583ff73844bb26e",
      "text": "> [!cc-header]  🧑‍🦳  **Customer Class** \n\n\n|Property|Description|\n|-|-|\n|id| Unique identifier|\n|CompanyID|Project Customer|\n|First|First Name|\n|Last|Last Name|\n\n\n\n> [!cc-footer] **Customer Entity**\n>- Each customer as a unique ID\n>- See contacts for individuals within the company\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 340,
      "x": 500,
      "y": -275
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 205,
      "id": "90128987f0ac7bcc",
      "text": "> [!cc-header]  👥  **Project Team Class** \n\n\n|Property|Description|\n|-|-|\n|id| Unique identifier|\n|ProjectID|Project Identifier|\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 340,
      "x": 950,
      "y": -652
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 363,
      "id": "1b550b5f489165ac",
      "text": "> [!cc-header]  🧔🧑‍🦰  **Team Members Class** \n\n\n|Property|Description|\n|-|-|\n|id| Unique identifier|\n|TeamId|Team Identifier|\n|EmployeeId|Employee Identifier|\n|CustomerId|Customer Identifier|\n\n> [!cc-footer] **Team composition**\n>Teams are made up of employees\n>and customer representatives\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 360,
      "x": 940,
      "y": -259
